=2 Walkthrough
>**{c=red:Warning:}** **{p:Trust Magic} CANNOT be used in this BCNM.**
!Temple of Uggalepih-map1.jpg|right|Map A
!Temple of Uggalepih-map2.jpg|right|Map B
!Den of Rancor-map1.jpg|right|Map 1
!Den of Rancor-map2.jpg|right|Map 2
!Den of Rancor-map6.jpg|right|Map 6
* Speak with {n:Edal-Tahdal} to obtain quest. If you are positive that you have the required fame but he is not allowing you to undertake this quest, continue speaking with him until his text changes. Once you have received the key item: {@k} {k:Tuning fork of water}, you can now safely undertake the quest.
* Travel to {z:Yhoator Jungle} and look for the entrance to {z:Temple of Uggalepih} at (J-12). Inside, if you do not already have the {@k} {k:Paintbrush of souls}, be sure to get it as you will need it ahead. Travel to (F-5) of the first map of the {z:Temple of Uggalepih} (Map A) to return to {z:Yhoator Jungle}. In {z:Yhoator Jungle}, follow the left wall to re-enter {z:Temple of Uggalepih}. In {z:Temple of Uggalepih} (Map B), continue to (I-7). Use the {@k} {k:Paintbrush of souls} on the empty Picture frame to open the door to the {z:Den of Rancor}. On the first map of {z:Den of Rancor} (Map C), drop down the hole at (J-7) to the 6th map (Map D) and enter the {z:Cloister of Tides} at (I-7).
** {p:Home Point} to {z:Den of Rancor} #2. If you do not have it yet. you may have HP #1 warp from Zilart missions.
*** From HP #1: go to Point A (I-5) on Map 2 to reach Map 1. Once you're in Map 1, drop down at (J-7).
** The Survival Guide for {z:Temple of Uggalepih} is located at the (F-5) exit of the first map.
** The {p:Unity} warp to {z:Den of Rancor} (under content level 128) allows you to bypass the need for a {@k} {k:Paintbrush of souls}.
* Defeat {m:Leviathan Prime} and you will receive a {@k} {k:Whisper of tides}
* Return to {n:Edal-Tahdal} with the whisper and he will provide several reward options including the ability to summon {p:Leviathan (Avatar)}.

=2 Notes
* Up to 6 party members can enter the arena.
* Each party member must have their own {@k} {k:Tuning fork of water}.
* Time limit is 30 minutes.
* You can only select **one** of the rewards {n:Edal-Tahdal} offers at any time.
* You may repeat this quest once per Earth day.
* You can save yourself a lot of time traveling to the Cloister by using the {@i:Mini Fork of Wtr.|1549} {i:Mini Fork of Wtr.|Mini Fork of Wtr.|1549} given by the quest {q:Trial-Size Trial by Water|Trial-Size Trial by Water|Trial-Size Trial by Water}. You must be on {p:Summoner} as your main job, and obtain the Mini Tuning Fork from {n:Verctissa}, trade the fork back to {n:Verctissa}, but enter the Protocrystal normally. So long as you do not clear the level 20 version of the BC, you may warp to the Cloister as many times as you wish.
* You may also choose to retain the whisper in order to complete the requirements for this quest: {q:The Moonlit Path|The Moonlit Path|The Moonlit Path}.

